# Raw Data

The raw H&M dataset is not included in this repository because of its size.

Required files:

- `articles.csv`
- `customers.csv`
- `transactions_train.csv`

Download the data from the Kaggle competition:

**https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/h-and-m-personalized-fashion-recommendations/data**

Place the three CSV files in this folder before running the PostgreSQL loading script.
